	(text "HDMI capture front-end -- the C4 architecture: HDMI-RX bridge into the module's CSI fingers"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 116.84 72.39 0)
		(effects (font (size 2 2) (thickness 0.35) (bold yes) (color 26 95 180 1)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "166366c3-c151-41f8-9722-4373e179b115")
	)
	(text "Bridge control is P4-OWNED (flag F11): I2C + RESET_N (R48 pull-down =\ncapture dead until the trust endpoint enables it) + INT terminate on the\nP4, not the module -- the module receives configured CSI only. The\nruntime-ingress surface is the HDMI path itself (EDID/InfoFrame parsing of\nhostile host output) -- named in the C2 row-14 honest-limits language.\nCSI lane map: CLK on RX_CD2, data on RX_CD0/1/3/4 -- UNVERIFIED (flag F5).\nLT6911-class part is CONSIGNED (flag F2): logical pins, re-pin at intake;\npower tree modeled as VDD33-only pending the real datasheet."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 116.84 199.39 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (color 21 96 61 1)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "0effca57-eab7-46dd-a7ef-c4e0d48e4ae1")
	)
